{"trace":{"trace_id":"kzDaWK8K7Abenzs_urNuE","skill_id":"exa-web-search","endpoint_id":"highlights","success":true,"status_code":200},"result":{"data":["## List organization repositories\n[...]\n```\nGET /orgs/{org}/repos\n\n```\n[...]\nLists repositories for the specified organization.\n[...]\n#### Path and query parameters\n[...]\n- `org` (string) (required)\n[...]\n```curl\ncurl -L \\\n  -X GET \\\n  https://api.github.com/orgs/ORG/repos\n[...]\nResponse schema (Status: 200):\n[...]\nArray of `Minimal Repository`:\n[...]\n- `id`: required, integer, format: int64\n- `node_id`: required, string\n- `name`: required, string\n- `full_name`: required, string\n[...]\n- `owner`: required, `Simple User`:\n[...]\n- `avatar_url`: required, string, format: uri\n[...]\n- `gravatar_id`: required, string or null\n[...]\n- `url`: required, string, format: uri\n[...]\n- `html_url`: required, string, format: uri\n[...]\n- `followers_url`: required, string, format: uri\n- `following_url`: required, string\n- `gists_url`: required, string\n- `starred_url`: required, string\n- `subscriptions_url`: required, string, format: uri\n[...]\n- `organizations_url`: required, string, format: uri\n- `repos_url`: required, string, format: uri\n[...]\n- `events_url`: required, string\n- `received_events_url`: required, string, format: uri\n[...]\n## Create an organization repository\n[...]\n```\nPOST /orgs/{org}/repos\n\n```\n[...]\nCreates a new repository in the specified organization. The authenticated user must be a member of the organization.\n[...]\n#### Path and query parameters\n[...]\n- `org` (string) (required)\n[...]\n#### Body parameters\n[...]\n- `name` (string) (required)\n[...]\n- `description` (string)\n[...]\nA short description of the repository.\n[...]\n- `homepage` (string)\n[...]\nA URL with\n[...]\nthe repository.\n[...]\n- `private` (\n[...]\n```curl\ncurl -L \\\n  -X POST \\\n  https://api.github.com/orgs/ORG/repos \\\n  -d '{\n  \"name\": \"Hello-World\",\n  \"description\": \"This is your first repository\",\n  \"homepage\": \"https://github.com\",\n  \"private\": false,\n  \"has_issues\": true,\n  \"has_projects\": true,\n  \"has_wiki\": true\n}'\n\n```\n[...]\n## Get a repository\n[...]\n```\nGET /repos/{owner}/{repo}\n\n```\n[...]\nThe parent and source objects are present when the repository is a fork. parent is the repository this repository was forked from, source is the ultimate source for the network.\n[...]\n#### Path and query parameters\n[...]\n- `owner` (string) (required)\n[...]\nThe account owner of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.\n[...]\n- `repo` (string) (required)\n[...]\n### HTTP response status\n[...]\n```curl\n[...]\n/repos/\n[...]\n## Update a repository\n[...]\n#### Path and query parameters\n[...]\n- `owner` (string) (required)\n[...]\n- `repo` (string) (required)\n[...]\n#### Body parameters\n[...]\n- `name` (string)\n[...]\n- `description` (string)\n[...]\nA short description of the repository.\n[...]\n- `homepage` (string)\n[...]\nA URL with more information\n[...]\nthe repository.\n[...]\n### Code examples\n[...]\n#### Path and query parameters\n[...]\n- `owner` (string) (required)\n[...]\n(string) (required)\n[...]\n#### Path and query parameters\n[...]\n- `owner` (string) (required)\n[...]\n- `repo` (string) (required)\n[...]\nresponse status codes\n[...]\n#### Path and query parameters\n[...]\n- `owner` (string) (required)\n[...]\nThe account owner of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.\n[...]\n- `repo` (string) (required)\n[...]\n#### Path and query parameters\n[...]\n- `owner` (string) (required)\n[...]\nThe account owner of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.\n[...]\n- `repo` (string) (required)\n[...]\n#### Path and query parameters\n[...]\n- `owner` (string) (required)\n[...]\n- `repo` (string) (required)\n[...]\n#### Path and query parameters\n[...]\n- `owner` (string) (required)\n[...]\nowner of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.\n[...]\n- `r